{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack from an advanced alien technology, they use portals to quickly spread across the world and destroying everything on a global scale. But they didn\u2019t count on an unlikely heroine and her nerdy little companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the invasion, unlock new technology, and keep moving!\u00a0 The world needs you! Groundskeeper throws you in the middle of a war, the war with supernatural robots from outer space.. yeah.. we went there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.poster.avif?t=1774342343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.webm?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.mp4?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play this game you will get further and have a better chance at surviving. You\u2019ll perma-unlock new weapons like the machine-gun, laser-gun, rocket-launcher, and tools like the all-destroying light beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to grab useful items like shields, time-slowdowns, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s more important: you\u2019ll unlock new worlds and hopefully become a true hero for the resistance\u2026 as you bring the fight to the planet of the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026or you die a quick death and try again..!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.poster.avif?t=1774342343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.webm?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.mp4?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast old-school Arcade game play style. This is designed for quick and short gameplay sessions that always last longer than you planned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perma unlock weapon upgrades, special power-ups and new worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy retro sound-track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and fun voice acted tutorial-cut-scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.poster.avif?t=1774342343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.webm?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.mp4?t=1774342343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Even the odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/d14473a79635ec1dea950971506934862036e18f.jpg"},{"name":"Crush the scenery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/338ec4127a154bed83ed27e113445629403928c1.jpg"},{"name":"Electrify","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/e33f0bfa9392213c3295fff6a0ece8334a35636a.jpg"},{"name":"Bit rain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/7ed8c510ad148c7a8bb7454c87657a3664b1b97c.jpg"},{"name":"Slay a dragon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/aba9dfd52f172db3d18ce6b7ba777d2698598ac2.jpg"},{"name":"Jetpack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/7c0aabdefa9cb384ef2a205a3b39d85d94159643.jpg"},{"name":"True hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/09ec3817312854b696b7c8463701a63e72640b53.jpg"},{"name":"Breach 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875340/266049afa58dbbb1fae00542e804dd846a2e5f1b.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875340?t=1774342343","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875340?t=1774342343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/7fed67aa6c48690f290c4c7e4d6e605fc1cffd7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774342343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/7fed67aa6c48690f290c4c7e4d6e605fc1cffd7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774342343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack from